wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/HonvedFC_03-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/HonvedFC_03-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36cf866 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"36cf866\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"293\">Our European opeations hub, Vulcan Shield Hungary was honoured to be part of the 9th Honv\u00e9d Motherson &amp; Vulcan Shield Cup International Youth Soccer Tournament, held at Bozsik Arena from March 12 to 15, 2026.<\/p><p data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"592\">The tournament brought together talented U15 teams from across Europe, including Honv\u00e9d, Paris Saint-Germain, Atalanta, Elche, Spartak Moscow, and Maribor. It was inspiring to see so many promising young players share the pitch, compete with passion, and represent the future of the sport.<\/p><p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"875\">A particularly meaningful moment for our team was seeing L\u00f3r\u00e1nt Komj\u00e1ti, Chief Operating Officer of Vulcan Shield Hungary, present the trophy to the winning teams. Being part of an event that celebrates youth talent, dedication, and sportsmanship was a privilege for all of us.<\/p><p data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1221\">At Vulcan Shield Hungary, we believe that supporting young people matters deeply. Whether in sport or in business, the next generation carries the future forward. Events like this are important not only because they showcase skill and determination, but also because they help nurture values such as teamwork, discipline, respect, and ambition.<\/p><p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1362\">We are proud to support initiatives that encourage young people to grow, dream bigger, and strive for excellence both on and off the field.<\/p><p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1559\">We warmly congratulate all participating teams for their effort and spirit, and especially Elche CF for winning the tournament. We are grateful to have been part of such a memorable occasion.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a23bf2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1a23bf2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ea993d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3ea993d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-103036d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"103036d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/HonvedFC_02-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attac